{"id":"53255a372e5c1ee8","group":"17","path":"17/17-df-model.md","title":"Model","display":"df-model — Model","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-df-model","aliases":["17-df-model"],"display":"df-model — Model","depends_on":["[[17-df-structure]]","[[17-df-assignment]]","[[17-df-satisfaction]]","[[17-df-sentence]]"],"source_section":"1.3","source_result":"truth, model, and consequence conventions","source_pages_print":[29,32],"source_pages_djvu":[45,48],"source_verification":"statement-compared; local equivalent formulation","label_origin":"local-catalog","local_revision":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-df-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-df-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-model — Model"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9b641c11eab6e875\" href=\"?note=9b641c11eab6e875\" title=\"17-df-assignment\">17-df-assignment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ec1305482f8eec2e\" href=\"?note=ec1305482f8eec2e\" title=\"17-df-satisfaction\">17-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1280f7fa724c1502\" href=\"?note=1280f7fa724c1502\" title=\"17-df-sentence\">17-df-sentence</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"1.3"},{"key":"source_result","html":"truth, model, and consequence conventions"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29</span><span>32</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>45</span><span>48</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"statement-compared; local equivalent formulation"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\\)</span>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A=(A,\\mathcal I)\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\">\\(\\mathfrak A=(A,\\mathcal I)\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-structure, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assign}(A)\">\\(\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assign}(A)\\)</span> (assignment, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9b641c11eab6e875\" href=\"?note=9b641c11eab6e875\" title=\"17-df-assignment\">17-df-assignment</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span> (sentence, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"1280f7fa724c1502\" href=\"?note=1280f7fa724c1502\" title=\"17-df-sentence\">17-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-theory)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mod}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Mod}(T)\\)</span> (model class, defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assign}(A)\\;\n\\mathrm{Sat}_L(\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\varphi),\\\\\n\\mathfrak A\\models T\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\varphi\\in T\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Mod}(T)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L):\\mathfrak A\\models T\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assign}(A)\\;\n\\mathrm{Sat}_L(\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\varphi),\\\\\n\\mathfrak A\\models T\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\varphi\\in T\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Mod}(T)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L):\\mathfrak A\\models T\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Sentence satisfaction is assignment-independent and is presented through universal quantification, as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"53255a372e5c1ee8\" href=\"?note=53255a372e5c1ee8\" title=\"17-df-model\">17-df-model</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"9b641c11eab6e875","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"ec1305482f8eec2e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"1280f7fa724c1502","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak A=(A,\\mathcal I)\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$ ($L$-structure, see [[17-df-structure]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"9b641c11eab6e875","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assign}(A)$ (assignment, see [[17-df-assignment]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"1280f7fa724c1502","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L$ (sentence, see [[17-df-sentence]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"53255a372e5c1ee8","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"Sentence satisfaction is assignment-independent and is presented through universal quantification, as in [[17-df-model]].","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A=(A,\\mathcal I)\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assign}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Mod}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi\n&\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assign}(A)\\;\n\\mathrm{Sat}_L(\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\varphi),\\\\\n\\mathfrak A\\models T\n&\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\varphi\\in T\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Mod}(T)\n&\\coloneqq\n\\{\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L):\\mathfrak A\\models T\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1540,"backlinks":[{"id":"caec72ff0a2438f3","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T$ (theory with model class $\\operatorname{Mod}(T)$, see [[17-df-model]])"},{"id":"cd3e154dc1b3bfce","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Mod}(T)$ (models of $T$, see [[17-df-model]])"},{"id":"401bc4f750ae4719","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Mod}(T)$ (models of $T$, see [[17-df-model]])"},{"id":"5b4c86c70dd29331","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L$ 固定，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$，$\\operatorname{Mod}(T)$ 见 [[17-df-model]]。\n$\\operatorname{Emb}_L(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)$ 为 [[17-df-embedding]] 的普通结构嵌入；$\\circ$ 为集合函数的复合。\n以下定义理论的一元谓词 $\\operatorname{Amalgamation}_L(T)$。所有结构量词都是 ZFC 元语言中的量词，模型类是可定义元类。"},{"id":"31cb5bc79934e98e","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$、$\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L$；模型、赋值集 $\\mathrm{Assign}(|\\mathfrak A|)$、满足关系见 [[17-df-model]]、[[17-df-assignment]]、[[17-df-satisfaction]]。此处定义公式层的 $T\\models_L\\varphi$ 与 $\\varphi\\equiv_T\\psi$，不限制公式为句子。"},{"id":"5a712e15961f1e3d","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T_i$ ($L_i$-theory with model class $\\operatorname{Mod}(T_i)$, see [[17-df-model]])"},{"id":"b0923b75f2632493","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L$ 为一阶语言，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$，见 [[17-df-sentence]]；$n\\in\\omega$ 且 $\\Sigma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}$，见 [[17-df-type]]。$\\operatorname{Mod}(T)$ 见 [[17-df-model]]；$\\operatorname{Realizes}_{L,n}$ 见 [[17-df-realizing-omitting-formula-sets]]；$\\varphi\\models_T\\psi$ 取 [[17-df-complete-formula]] 的相对后承。以下在这些输入上定义 $\\operatorname{LocallyRealizes}_{T,n}$ 与 $\\operatorname{LocallyOmits}_{T,n}$；语言由 $T$ 的指定语境 $L$ 固定。"},{"id":"59d623a1692279f1","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T$ (theory with model class $\\operatorname{Mod}(T)$, see [[17-df-model]])"},{"id":"31695c838dded93c","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L$ 固定，$T,T^*\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$，$\\operatorname{ModelCompanion}_L$ 见 [[17-df-model-companion]]。\n$\\operatorname{Mod}$ 见 [[17-df-model]]，$L(\\mathfrak A)$ 及 $\\operatorname{Diag}(\\mathfrak A)$ 见 [[17-df-diagram]]。\n对每个 $\\mathfrak A\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)$，把 $T^*$ 的句子按同一字符串包含进 $L(\\mathfrak A)$；$\\operatorname{Complete}(T^*\\cup\\operatorname{Diag}(\\mathfrak A))$ 是 [[17-df-theory-properties]] 的完全性谓词在语言 $L(\\mathfrak A)$ 的实例，包含可满足性。\n以下定义 $\\operatorname{ModelCompletion}_L(T^*,T)$，参数次序与模型伴随相同。"},{"id":"3ed1bbae3ef8ad93","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Mod}(T)$ (the class of models of $T$, see [[17-df-model]])"},{"id":"0626faf5263e31f8","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T$ (theory with model class $\\operatorname{Mod}(T)$, see [[17-df-model]])"},{"id":"a29b7cd698a7afca","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Mod}(T)$ (models of $T$, see [[17-df-model]])"},{"id":"086b1b3d5b60a929","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$ is an $L$-theory; $\\operatorname{Mod}(T)$ is from [[17-df-model]]."},{"id":"e318e28bff8754a3","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Mod}(T)$ (models of $T$, see [[17-df-model]])"},{"id":"e6a4ebf476ad2f6d","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Mod}(T)$ (models of $T$, see [[17-df-model]])"},{"id":"a09db7c2dab60d0a","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Mod}(T)$ (models of $T$, see [[17-df-model]])"},{"id":"105ca7a585f377f9","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L$ 是固定的一阶语言，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$。$\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$、$\\mathrm{Mod}(T)$ 与 $\\models$ 见 [[17-df-model]]；$\\subseteq_L$ 见 [[17-df-elementary-substructure]]；$\\operatorname{ChainUnion}_L$ 见 [[17-df-chain-union]]。\n量化的指标 $I$ 为集合，$<$ 为其二元关系，$(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I}$ 为定义域恰为 $I$ 的结构族；$\\operatorname{ChainUnion}_L$ 已要求非空线序及相容子结构链。以下引入二个以理论为参数的元语言谓词。"},{"id":"bd7acd1192e46962","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Mod}(T)$ (model class, see [[17-df-model]])"},{"id":"a2084db1d8bf7af0","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Mod}(T)$、$\\operatorname{Saturated}_{\\aleph_1}$ 见 [[17-df-model]]、[[17-df-cardinal-saturation]]。"},{"id":"07adad8c036296f7","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Mod}(T)$ (models of $T$, see [[17-df-model]])"},{"id":"dfd67e8971cfe467","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Mod}(T)$ 见 [[17-df-model]]；$\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L$ 见 [[17-df-elementary-embedding]]。"},{"id":"abf539a1037d08d1","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L$ 固定，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$，$\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$。\n$T_\\forall$ 见 [[17-df-universal-consequences]]，$\\operatorname{Mod}$ 见 [[17-df-model]]，$\\operatorname{Emb}_L(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)$ 见 [[17-df-embedding]]。\n证明使用 [[17-df-diagram]] 的图示及 [[17-thm-compactness]] 的紧致性。"},{"id":"a628b44ab2781524","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L$ 为一阶语言，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$。$|L|$ 与 $\\aleph_0$ 见 [[17-df-language-cardinality]]；$\\operatorname{Complete}$ 见 [[17-df-theory-properties]]；$\\operatorname{Mod}(T)$ 见 [[17-df-model]]。$\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}$ 见 [[17-df-type]]；$\\models_T$ 与 $\\operatorname{Complete}_{T,n}$ 见 [[17-df-complete-formula]]；$\\operatorname{Atomic}_T$ 见 [[17-df-atomic-model]]。实现公式集谓词 $\\operatorname{Realizes}_{L,n}$ 见 [[17-df-realizing-omitting-formula-sets]]。证明使用 [[17-df-local-omission]] 的局部省略及 [[17-thm-extended-omitting-types]]。"},{"id":"a56231382327ecde","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Mod}(T')$ (model class, see [[17-df-model]])"},{"id":"ca75e0773ad7e836","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Mod}(T')$ (model class, see [[17-df-model]])"},{"id":"4646e8fdeb7322ed","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L$ 固定，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$。$\\operatorname{ChainUnionPreservedTheory}_L$ 见 [[17-df-theory-preservation]]，$\\mathrm{ForallExistsSent}_L$ 见 [[17-df-quantifier-prefix-fragments]]，$\\mathrm{Mod}$ 见 [[17-df-model]]。模型类在同一语言 $L$ 的 ZFC 元语言中比较；链须非空。"},{"id":"49c16a998c61a1e3","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Mod}(T)$ (model class, see [[17-df-model]])"},{"id":"67e164c877491dc2","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Mod}(T)$ (model class, see [[17-df-model]])"},{"id":"e64b40822eb5f1aa","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Mod}(T)$ (model class, see [[17-df-model]])"},{"id":"de1a11e45b1a5282","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Mod}(T)$ (model class, see [[17-df-model]])"},{"id":"f66dca8adb2ce568","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Mod}(T)$ (model class, see [[17-df-model]])"},{"id":"7a9661711dbc540e","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L$ 为一阶语言，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$。$|L|$ 与 $\\aleph_0$ 见 [[17-df-language-cardinality]]；$\\operatorname{Complete}$ 见 [[17-df-theory-properties]]；$S_n(T)$ 见 [[17-df-type]]；$\\operatorname{Mod}(T)$ 见 [[17-df-model]]。$m:\\omega\\to\\omega$，$(p_n)_{n\\in\\omega}$ 为公式集序列。$\\operatorname{Realized}_{\\mathfrak A}$ 见 [[17-df-type-realization]]，$\\operatorname{NonIsolated}_T$ 见 [[17-df-non-isolated-types]]；两接口均在内部绑定有限元数。一般公式集的实现及局部省略见 [[17-df-realizing-omitting-formula-sets]]、[[17-df-local-omission]]，证明使用 [[17-thm-extended-omitting-types]]。"},{"id":"7aaf4c313fa6fd4d","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Mod}$ (model-class operation, see [[17-df-model]])"},{"id":"3765fb2168038a13","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Mod}(T)$ (model class, see [[17-df-model]])"},{"id":"3562afbb432025e3","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Mod}$ (model-class operation, see [[17-df-model]])"},{"id":"400a658908591f62","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L$ 为一阶语言，语言大小 $|L|$ 见 [[17-df-language-cardinality]]，$\\aleph_0$ 为最小无限基数。$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$ 见 [[17-df-sentence]]；一致性谓词 $\\operatorname{Consistent}$ 与模型类 $\\operatorname{Mod}(T)$ 见 [[17-df-theory-properties]]、[[17-df-model]]。$m:\\omega\\to\\omega$，$(\\Sigma_r)_{r\\in\\omega}$ 为公式集序列，且每个 $\\Sigma_r\\subseteq\\mathrm{Form}_{L,m(r)}$，见 [[17-df-type]]。局部省略与模型省略分别取 [[17-df-local-omission]] 和 [[17-df-realizing-omitting-formula-sets]]；$\\operatorname{card}(X)$ 为集合基数。"},{"id":"4b63c4b193ffc453","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Mod}$ (model class, see [[17-df-model]])"},{"id":"a7bf11e2f518df7b","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Mod}(T)$ (model class, see [[17-df-model]])"},{"id":"a79cd0c61a8bf7df","anchor":"ref-9","location